    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THIS GAME IS ABOUT BEING A DEADLY NINJA ASSASSIN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a lethal combination of grappling, martial arts and esoteric ninjutsu techniques to complete your mission and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/71fd0d0449ce9c0063ef821ac0558c6c.poster.avif?t=1751915304\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/71fd0d0449ce9c0063ef821ac0558c6c.webm?t=1751915304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/71fd0d0449ce9c0063ef821ac0558c6c.mp4?t=1751915304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>(He's going to need glasses!)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HIGHLY INTERACTIVE NPCS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Target different body parts to inflict pain in amazingly sadistic ways. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/1281e51227f1531656bb5c3148e22809.poster.avif?t=1751915304\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/1281e51227f1531656bb5c3148e22809.webm?t=1751915304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/1281e51227f1531656bb5c3148e22809.mp4?t=1751915304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes that's real pain he's feeling!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >USE SPEED AND STEALTH TO AVOID BEING OVERWHELMED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies call for help and work together when alerted. Sow chaos to open up a path to your target.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/3413a7049135f814923add73dc490cae.poster.avif?t=1751915304\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/3413a7049135f814923add73dc490cae.webm?t=1751915304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/3413a7049135f814923add73dc490cae.mp4?t=1751915304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE FRIENDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring NPCs back to your hideout to build up your gang.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/15b527b37e010301ce2da8d76dbfcbac.poster.avif?t=1751915304\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/15b527b37e010301ce2da8d76dbfcbac.webm?t=1751915304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/15b527b37e010301ce2da8d76dbfcbac.mp4?t=1751915304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then your real life friend can play as them!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/32b86c5cf44513bf117017fdba1939ad.poster.avif?t=1751915304\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/32b86c5cf44513bf117017fdba1939ad.webm?t=1751915304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/32b86c5cf44513bf117017fdba1939ad.mp4?t=1751915304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TONS OF ITEMS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...with multiple uses! Disarm any enemy and use their weapon against them.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/9c26b94a6067ad1c72f2d8dced76af8b.poster.avif?t=1751915304\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/9c26b94a6067ad1c72f2d8dced76af8b.webm?t=1751915304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/9c26b94a6067ad1c72f2d8dced76af8b.mp4?t=1751915304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DISCLAIMER:\u00a0<i>Bananas were officially introduced to Japan in <strong>1903</strong>, when they started being imported from Taiwan. However, it's believed that the first banana ever brought to Japan was presented to the warrior Nobunaga Oda by a Portuguese missionary.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Isn't it fascinating how such a common fruit has such a rich history?</i> \ud83c\udf4c</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER TECHNIQUES ONLY REAL NINJAS ARE CAPABLE OF</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/1cedfeb596a0be14d776398fccba8e46.poster.avif?t=1751915304\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/1cedfeb596a0be14d776398fccba8e46.webm?t=1751915304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/1cedfeb596a0be14d776398fccba8e46.mp4?t=1751915304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THIS GAME IS ABOUT BEING A DEADLY NINJA ASSASSIN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a lethal combination of grappling, martial arts and esoteric ninjutsu techniques to complete your mission and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/71fd0d0449ce9c0063ef821ac0558c6c.poster.avif?t=1751915304\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/71fd0d0449ce9c0063ef821ac0558c6c.webm?t=1751915304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/71fd0d0449ce9c0063ef821ac0558c6c.mp4?t=1751915304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>(He's going to need glasses!)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HIGHLY INTERACTIVE NPCS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Target different body parts to inflict pain in amazingly sadistic ways. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/1281e51227f1531656bb5c3148e22809.poster.avif?t=1751915304\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/1281e51227f1531656bb5c3148e22809.webm?t=1751915304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/1281e51227f1531656bb5c3148e22809.mp4?t=1751915304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes that's real pain he's feeling!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >USE SPEED AND STEALTH TO AVOID BEING OVERWHELMED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies call for help and work together when alerted. Sow chaos to open up a path to your target.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/3413a7049135f814923add73dc490cae.poster.avif?t=1751915304\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/3413a7049135f814923add73dc490cae.webm?t=1751915304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/3413a7049135f814923add73dc490cae.mp4?t=1751915304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE FRIENDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring NPCs back to your hideout to build up your gang.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/15b527b37e010301ce2da8d76dbfcbac.poster.avif?t=1751915304\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/15b527b37e010301ce2da8d76dbfcbac.webm?t=1751915304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/15b527b37e010301ce2da8d76dbfcbac.mp4?t=1751915304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then your real life friend can play as them!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/32b86c5cf44513bf117017fdba1939ad.poster.avif?t=1751915304\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/32b86c5cf44513bf117017fdba1939ad.webm?t=1751915304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/32b86c5cf44513bf117017fdba1939ad.mp4?t=1751915304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TONS OF ITEMS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...with multiple uses! Disarm any enemy and use their weapon against them.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/9c26b94a6067ad1c72f2d8dced76af8b.poster.avif?t=1751915304\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/9c26b94a6067ad1c72f2d8dced76af8b.webm?t=1751915304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/9c26b94a6067ad1c72f2d8dced76af8b.mp4?t=1751915304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DISCLAIMER:\u00a0<i>Bananas were officially introduced to Japan in <strong>1903</strong>, when they started being imported from Taiwan. However, it's believed that the first banana ever brought to Japan was presented to the warrior Nobunaga Oda by a Portuguese missionary.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Isn't it fascinating how such a common fruit has such a rich history?</i> \ud83c\udf4c</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER TECHNIQUES ONLY REAL NINJAS ARE CAPABLE OF</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/1cedfeb596a0be14d776398fccba8e46.poster.avif?t=1751915304\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/1cedfeb596a0be14d776398fccba8e46.webm?t=1751915304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634550/extras/1cedfeb596a0be14d776398fccba8e46.mp4?t=1751915304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
